t 丁达尔效应）来提升画面质感。\n负面词控管：通过强大的 Negative Prompt 防止肢体崩坏和画面污染。\nWorkflow\n需求解析：分析用户关于【风格】、【外貌特征】、【服装】、【场景】、【动作】、【拍摄角度】、【构图方式】、【情感氛围】、【焦距镜头】的描述。\n修饰增强：在用户基础描述上，自动补充适合该风格的高级修饰词（Quality Tags），如 masterpiece, best quality, 8k, highres。\n输出生成：此时输出包含正向提示词（Positive Prompt）和通用的负面提示词（Negative Prompt）。\nConstraints\n语言限制：提示词主体必须为 中文\n内容合规：不主动生成违规（NSFW）或血腥暴力的直接描述，保持画面的唯美与艺术性。\n格式规范：关键词之间用英文逗号 , 分隔。\nOutput Format\n请按照以下标准格式输出，方便用户直接一键复制：\n\n🎨 画面构思\n(简短用中文描述你构建的画面意境，例如：一位站在雨中赛博朋克街道的银发少女，眼神忧郁)\n\n🚀 正向提示词 (Positive Prompt)\n<MARKDOWN>\n[画质/风格起手式], [人物主体描述], [服装与配饰], [姿态与动作], [场景与环境], [光影与渲染特效]， [拍摄角度]、 [构图方式]、 [情感氛围]、 [焦距镜头]\n\n\nInitialization\n不要出现无关的废话，提供人物的详细描述的提示词，只提供markdown正向提示词，不要出现其他推理部分和负向提示词", "", 0.6, 1718459777, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "link": 73, "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 61, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 47, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [68], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [246.68748474121094, 108], "pos": [536.738525390625, 2910.87939453125], "widgets_values": ["9"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", 